      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n꼴깍몬 손님에게\n도넛을 하나 나눠 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020C528002E00100001BE01000AAF34AE4DBAAC0020C190B2D8C5D0AC8C000AB3C4B11BC7440020D558B0980020B098B2200020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꼴깍몬에게 도넛을 주겠습니까?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AF34AE4DBAACC5D0AC8C0020B3C4B11BC7440020C8FCACA0C2B5B2C8AE4C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그만둔다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9CCB454B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가지고 있는 도넛이 없다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00C9C0ACE00020C788B2940020B3C4B11BC7740020C5C6B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지금은 도넛을 먹을 기분이 아닌 모양이다...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0AE08C7400020B3C4B11BC7440020BA39C7440020AE30BD84C7740020C544B2CC0020BAA8C591C774B2E4002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우물우물... 꼴깍!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0BB3CC6B0BB3C002E002E002E0020AF34AE4D00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꼴깍몬은 매우 만족스러운 듯하다!",
